<title>LATVIA: OLAINFARM STABLE AS BOURSE PRICES SET.</title>
<headline>OLAINFARM STABLE AS BOURSE PRICES SET.</headline>
<dateline>RIGA 1997-06-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in bourse newcomer Olainfarm</p>
<p>were stable at 2.45 lats on Tuesday as the prices were set in</p>
<p>the early session.</p>
<p>Before the shares were quoted, brokers had predicted a price</p>
<p>of between 1.5 and 1.9 lats and some on Monday said the price</p>
<p>was set to fall in the coming week.</p>
<p>Other shares can be bought (B) or sold (S) at the following</p>
<p>prices and in the following volume, the bourse said in a</p>
<p>statement.</p>
